    "summary": "The user is asking for pediatric acetaminophen dosing for a 38lb child and expressing concern over lethargy and dehydration. The assistant initially provides a highly dangerous overdose recommendation (12.5ml), corrects it to a roughly accurate dose (5ml) after user pushback, and then provides standard advice regarding hydration and contacting a pediatrician due to lethargy.",
